Recommends: python3-usb,
            systemd | elogind,
            acpid
Description: ASUS ZenBook Duo keyboard and platform utilities
 CLI tools for ASUS ZenBook Duo / Pro Duo laptops: keyboard brightness,
 hotkeys, platform profile, ScreenPad, fan control, and sleep/resume hooks.
 .
 This package installs userspace scripts only. The optional out-of-tree
 hid-asus kernel module is not built here; see kernel/README.md upstream.
 .
 For Plasma 6 System Settings (KCM), install the zenbook-scripts-plasma
 package (Ubuntu 24.04+ / Debian with KF6).

Package: zenbook-scripts-plasma
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         zenbook-scripts (= ${source:Version}),
         qml6-module-qtquick,
         qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
         qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
         libkf6kcmutils6,
         libkf6coreaddons6,
         libkf6i18n6,
         libkirigami6
Description: Plasma 6 System Settings module for zenbook-scripts
 KCM plugin (kcm_zenbook_platform) for profiles, touchpad, Duo displays,
 and sleep/resume policy. Requires zenbook-scripts CLI package.
 .
 Build from the same source as zenbook-scripts; not useful without it.
